            <p class="feature-description">Marketing automation, email campaigns, and customer loyalty programs built-in.</p>
            <ul class="feature-benefits">
              <li>Email campaigns</li>
              <li>SMS marketing</li>
              <li>Loyalty programs</li>
              <li>Referral tracking</li>
