              <i class="fas fa-shopping-cart" style="color: #25D366; margin-right: 0.5rem;"></i> Order Fulfillment
            </h4>
            <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0;">
              <li style="padding: 0.8rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;">
