              </li>
              <li style="padding: 0.8rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;">
                <strong>Fulfillment:</strong> Automate shipping and delivery tracking
              </li>
              <li style="padding: 0.8rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;">
                <strong>Notifications:</strong> Auto-send order updates to customers
              </li>
              <li style="padding: 0.8rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;">
